# One line away from aa.doctrine: production tilts the hovertank share up
# whenever the visible threat flies, instead of holding three tanks to one
# hovertank regardless. The tilt can only repeat types already in the goals,
# which is why the counter question needs this mix -- against all-tank goals
# the flag is inert ([[mechanics-combat-profile]]).

name aa-counter
goals extractorT1,extractorT1,extractorT1,c_tank,c_tank,c_tank,hoverTank
heavies none
max_workers 8
mass 25
reserve -1
expand 1
counter 1
cover 1
intercept 0
guard_cap 0
aa_cover 0
forward 0
scout 0
raid 0
rush 0
creep 0
riposte 0
tech 0
